ed_category_count":4},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","review_id":"DQKRizzjMUMJcrGUM-AxEg","date":"2017-04-18T11:59:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9422838687896729,"text_excerpt":"We came here twice during our 4 day trip to New Orleans, which probably says something in itself. The first time we came in for their happy hour special ($9 for a dozen oysters, what a deal!). We gladly ordered two dozen and some drinks. They have all local beers on draft, and the sazerac we ordered were the best we had in New Orleans, including compared against some we had at fine dining restaurants. The bartender gave great service and it really made us want to return. The second time we stopped in, we came early in the morning before our plane left. We really wanted to load up on some more oysters before we left New Orleans, and our server was kind enough to agree to serve us raw oyste..."},{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","review_id":"CmI64sHJ8MaVuVurDXca4g","date":"2021-06-08T05:34:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365471601486206,"text_excerpt":"Oysters and oysters. Came for a late dinner and the oysters hit the spot. Got the chargrilled and creole flavored ones and the were delicious. The creole had a nice spice pop that was great. Nice ambiance but a funky playlist (you'll see when you get there). Good service and this place deserves your business..."},{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","review_id":"m2eDt-cW2anSDEaDSkWoQA","date":"2019-07-06T14:08:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9361820220947266,"text_excerpt":"The food here is good but not great or extraordinary or mindblowing. My boyfriend and I came here on a Friday around 7 pm and the place was probably half full. We ordered a dozen raw oysters to start off with which costed $16 bucks. Not too bad. If you can make happy hour here which runs from 3-6 on weekdays you can get a dozen for $10. Oysters were fresh and juicy. They gave us 4 extra oysters. I don't know if it was a mistake or if they were just being nice but I ain't complaining. We also ordered the red beans and rice appetizer size. It was a little salty in my opinion but portions were big for an app. For our entree we shared the oysters platter which was more than enough for the two..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","photo_id":"cklpUVFnNF4WxE4yMCRyZw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/cklpUVFnNF4WxE4yMCRyZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8798001408576965},{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","photo_id":"MytR-m59ubk1FrfPZxfB_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MytR-m59ubk1FrfPZxfB_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8728846311569214},{"business_id":"swVdc9piXvG0AXwL-F0GfQ","photo_id":"yY3bgzBfDtRlgc-25ZlJeg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yY